# Mandala Codes — redirect rules
# Processed top-to-bottom, first match wins.

# Legacy /oracle/* paths (in case anyone copied a URL from the old domain
# before adrianrasmussen.com's 301s were in place). The SPA also handles
# these via <Navigate>, but a server-side 301 is preferred for crawlers.
/oracle                         /                               301
/oracle/the-systems             /the-systems                    301
/oracle/universal-language      /universal-language             301
/oracle/universal-language/*    /universal-language/:splat      301

# Lightweaver moved off /lightweaver/* on the mandalacodes.com host onto
# led.mandalacodes.com root. Old bookmarks 301 to the new home so they
# don't break. The SPA also handles these via <Navigate> on the
# mandalacodes.com side; the server-side redirect catches link crawlers.
https://mandalacodes.com/lightweaver                          https://led.mandalacodes.com/                       301
https://mandalacodes.com/lightweaver/control/:host            https://led.mandalacodes.com/control/:host          301
https://www.mandalacodes.com/lightweaver                      https://led.mandalacodes.com/                       301
https://www.mandalacodes.com/lightweaver/control/:host        https://led.mandalacodes.com/control/:host          301
